      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Breaking the script\" isn't about changing your genes; it's about changing your *response* to the inevitable. If the pattern is the scenery, you can choose to be the actor who walks off stage, or the one who simply refuses to perform the lines. It's a small, internal act of defiance against the expectation. Think of it as choosing a different ending, even if the beginning looks the same.",
